        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi kakuli muntu aumwi iwakasinsima muzina lya-Jehova, Uriya mwana wa-Semaya waku-Kiriati-Jearimu. Wakasinsima aamunzi uno anyika ino majwi aakali mbubonya mbuli majwi aa-Jeremiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
